            </h2>
            <div class="h-12 w-[1px] bg-white/30 mx-auto"></div>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed tracking-wider">
                C/Vision Web Design<br/>
                //澄視維度設計//
            </p>
            
            <ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest pt-8 border-t border-white/20 w-full max-w-2xl mt-8">
                <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-[#ffeeaf]">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-[#ffeeaf]">World</a></li>
                <li><a href="/portfolio" class="hover:text-[#ffeeaf]">Portfolio</a></li>
